><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549190/extras/aa8efdfe8c2e739f430ef0949cf6bb94.webm?t=1773211023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549190/extras/aa8efdfe8c2e739f430ef0949cf6bb94.mp4?t=1773211023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progressive Puzzle Solving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●Puzzles with just the right level of difficulty—not too hard but still challenging.<br>●Puzzle-solving is closely integrated with the plot. Solve the puzzles and uncover the truth hidden beneath layers of mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549190/extras/d6a7a054dc9c733db039eb1a9f505577.poster.avif?t=1773211023\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549190/extras/d6a7a054dc9c733db039eb1a9f505577.webm?t=1773211023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549190/extras/d6a7a054dc9c733db039eb1a9f505577.mp4?t=1773211023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
